{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1517747-alternative-spheres","id":1517747,"title":"Alternative Spheres","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-12T02:36:25-07:00","id":1517747,"title":"Alternative Spheres","content":"One of the benefits of the magic system in Mage: The Ascension<br /> is that it encourages the players to think outside the box and<br /> challenge their assumptions about how the world works. The<br /> magic system is based on nine spheres of influence, such as<br /> Correspondence, Forces, Life, Mind, and Spirit, that represent<br /> different aspects of reality. Each sphere has a rating from<br /> 1 to 5, indicating the level of mastery and control that the<br /> mage has over that aspect. The higher the rating, the more<br /> complex and powerful effects the mage can achieve.<br /> <br /> Mage: The Ascension is a role-playing game that explores the<br /> themes of magic, reality, and belief. In the game, mages are<br /> individuals who can manipulate reality with their will, using<br /> a system of nine spheres that represent different aspects of<br /> existence. However, some mages may choose to use alternate<br /> spheres, either as a supplement or a replacement for the<br /> standard ones. In this article, we will discuss some of the<br /> reasons and implications of using alternate spheres in<br /> Mage: The Ascension.<br /> <br /> One reason to use alternate spheres is to reflect a different<br /> paradigm or worldview. The nine spheres are based on the Hermetic<br /> tradition of Western occultism, which may not suit every mage's<br /> culture, background, or philosophy. For example, a Native American<br /> mage may prefer to use the four elements of earth, air, fire, and<br /> water instead of the spheres of matter, forces, life, and spirit.<br /> A Buddhist mage may use the five skandhas of form, sensation,<br /> perception, mental formations, and consciousness instead of the<br /> spheres of correspondence, mind, entropy, prime, and time. A<br /> cyberpunk mage may use the five nodes of data, hardware, software,<br /> wetware, and netware instead of the spheres of correspondence,<br /> matter, forces, life, and mind.<br /> <br /> Another reason to use alternate spheres is to create a unique or<br /> specialized style of magic. The nine spheres are broad and<br /> encompassing, but they may not cover every possible effect or<br /> expression of magic. For example, a mage who specializes in dreams<br /> may use the sphere of oneiros instead of the sphere of mind. A mage<br /> who focuses on healing may use the sphere of salus instead of the<br /> sphere of life. A mage who deals with fate and destiny may use the<br /> sphere of fortuna instead of the sphere of entropy.<br /> <br /> Using alternate spheres can have both advantages and disadvantages<br /> for mages. On one hand, it can allow them to access effects or<br /> abilities that are not possible or difficult with the standard<br /> spheres. It can also help them to avoid paradox, the backlash that<br /> occurs when reality rejects their magic, by using more subtle or<br /> appropriate forms of magic for their paradigm. On the other hand,<br /> it can limit their versatility and compatibility with other mages<br /> who use different systems. It can also expose them to new dangers<br /> or enemies that are related to their alternate spheres.<br /> <br /> Using alternate spheres in Mage: The Ascension can be a rewarding<br /> and challenging way to explore different aspects of magic and reality.<br /> However, it is not without risks and consequences. Mages who use<br /> alternate spheres should be aware of their benefits and drawbacks,<br /> and be prepared to face the challenges and opportunities that come<br /> with them.<br /> <br /> Using alternate spheres can make the game more realistic in<br /> several ways. First, it can reflect the diversity and complexity<br /> of human cultures and beliefs, and show that there is no one<br /> true way to understand and manipulate reality. Second, it can<br /> create more interesting and dynamic conflicts between mages who<br /> have different paradigms and systems of magic, and challenge them<br /> to find common ground or overcome their differences. Third, it<br /> can encourage creativity and experimentation among players and<br /> storytellers, who can explore new aspects of magic and reality<br /> that are not limited by the standard rules and assumptions of the<br /> game.<br /> <br /> I've created a system of 12 spheres which I use in my game.<br /> They are listed here, and described in detail:<br /> <br /> 01. Sphere of Prediction<br /> 02. Sphere of Feeling<br /> 03. Sphere of Production<br /> 04. Sphere of Influence<br /> 05. Sphere of Penetration<br /> 06. Sphere of Control<br /> 07. Sphere of Restoration<br /> 08. Sphere of Vanishing<br /> 09. Sphere of Travel<br /> 10. Sphere of Transformation<br /> 11. Sphere of Destruction<br /> 12. Sphere of Revelation\u200b<br /> <br /> There are 12 Spheres in this system. Each Sphere connects to one of the 12 signs of the Zodiac. And each Zodiac sign connects to one of 10 planets in Astrology. The 10 planets and 12 signs connect with the 22 Major Arcana of the Tarot.<br /> <br /> Everything in the universe of Mage exists as Body Mind and Spirit. Events in this universe follow patterns of Dynamism, Stasis, and Entropy. Each Sphere of magic follows into these categories. Outlined here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Body Control: Energy / Telekinesis (Aries / Emperor) + (Mars / Tower) Transformation: Developing / Shapeshifting (Taurus / Hierophant) + (Venus / Empress)</pre> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Spirit Prediction: Wisdom / ESP (Libra / Justice) + (Venus / Empress) Revelation: Visions / Rapture (Pisces / High Priestess) + (Neptune / Hanged Man)</pre> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Mind Feeling: Empathy / Telepathy (Virgo / Hermit) + (Mercury / Magician) Influence: Charisma / Hypnotism (Leo / Strength) + (Sun / Sun)</pre> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Dynamism Penetration: Escape / Intangibility (Gemini / Lovers) + (Mercury / Magician) Travel: Direction / Teleportation (Sagittarius / Temperance) + (Jupiter / Wheel of Fortune)</pre> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Stasis Production: Attraction / Creation (Capricorn / Devil) + (Saturn / World) Restoration: Renewal / Healing (Aquarius / Star) + (Uranus / Fool)</pre> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Entropy Vanishing: Stealth / Invisibility (Cancer / Chariot) + (Moon / Moon) Destruction: Curses / Annihilation (Scorpio / Death) + (Pluto / Judgement)</pre> </div>Each Sphere is ranked by a scale of 5 dots<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Awareness \u2022\u2022 Sympathetic \u2022\u2022\u2022 Coincidental \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Manipulative \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Miraculous</pre> </div>The Spheres are further defined here:<br /> <br /> <br /> Power of Prediction - Wisdom/ESP<br /> <br /> Realization - Unveiling the inner knowledge within.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Prediction manifests as inspiration and insight, granting effortless access to answers and discoveries beyond conventional understanding. It endows the practitioner with the gift of foreknowledge. The key to unlocking this power lies in the realization that all knowledge already resides within oneself.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Elevated Mental Functions \u2022\u2022 Increase to Skills \u2022\u2022\u2022 Influencing Situations \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Seeing the Future \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Slowing Time</pre> </div>Power of Feeling - Empathy/Telepathy<br /> <br /> Association - Recognizing the interconnectedness of all things.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Feeling enables one to empathize and understand others deeply, perceiving their thoughts and emotions without the need for words. It stems from the profound insight into the Association, the intrinsic link that binds all living beings together.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Reading Mindstates \u2022\u2022 Bonus to Social Abilities \u2022\u2022\u2022 Mental Shield \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Reading Thoughts \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Mental Link</pre> </div>Power of Production - Attraction/Creation<br /> <br /> Synchronicity - Uniting the threads of existence.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Production empowers a wizard to draw situations and desires into their reality. This ability stems from a profound understanding of Synchronicity, the cosmic principle that everything is interconnected and influences each other. It acknowledges that the power to attract lies within, awaiting manifestation.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Sensing Opportunity \u2022\u2022 Arranging situations \u2022\u2022\u2022 Attracting Wealth \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Produce Small Objects \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Win Lotteries &amp; Elections</pre> </div>Power of Influence - Charisma/Hypnotism<br /> <br /> Possession - Will shaping the realm of the mind.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Influence grants a wizard the power to captivate others. Known as Possession, it allows one to enchant and charm, eliciting positive perceptions or even gaining control over another's thoughts and actions. The essence of this mastery lies in the understanding that one's will can wield dominion over the minds of others.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Sensing Willpower \u2022\u2022 Social Influence \u2022\u2022\u2022 Hypnotic Suggestion \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Mind Control \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Altering Identities</pre> </div>Power of Penetration - Escape/Intangibility<br /> <br /> Spiritualism - Perceiving the world as a realm of spirit.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Penetration delves into the realm of Spiritualism. It unveils the truth that the world is fundamentally composed of spirit, allowing a wizard to transcend physical boundaries and become intangible. Chains and locks lose their hold, dissolving effortlessly under the wizard's touch.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Find Exits \u2022\u2022 Open Locks \u2022\u2022\u2022 Escape From Restraints \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Escape From Prisons \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Becoming Intangible</pre> </div>Power of Control - Energy/Telekinesis<br /> <br /> Evocation - Harnessing the forces of the spiritual realm.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Control enables a wizard to command powerful forces. Through evocation, the practitioner can manipulate energy and bend it to their will. This understanding arises from recognizing that spiritual entities are themselves embodiments of force and possess the capacity to shape and impact the physical world.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Quick Reactions \u2022\u2022 Bonus to Physical Abilities \u2022\u2022\u2022 Influencing Physical Outcomes \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Moving Objects \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Controlling Natural Forces</pre> </div>Power of Restoration - Renewal/Healing<br /> <br /> Forgiveness - Liberating from suffering caused by transgressions.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Restoration holds the gift of healing. It grants the ability to alleviate pain, cure diseases, and bring renewal to the afflicted. This power emerges from the understanding of Forgiveness, recognizing that suffering often stems from transgressions. By embracing forgiveness, a wizard becomes a conduit for healing and restoration.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Sense illness \u2022\u2022 Relieve Pain \u2022\u2022\u2022 Protection from Disease \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Heal Sickness / Damage \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Resurrection</pre> </div>Power of Vanishing - Stealth/Invisibility<br /> <br /> Misdirection - Manipulating attention and perception.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Vanishing encompasses the art of Misdirection. It allows a wizard to control focus and attention, rendering themselves unseen and secrets concealed. Meticulous study and practice grant the ability to achieve complete invisibility as the wizard manipulates perception and directs attention elsewhere.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 See in The Dark \u2022\u2022 Safeguarding Secrets \u2022\u2022\u2022 Stealth \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Disguise \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Invisibility</pre> </div>Power of Travel - Direction/Teleportation<br /> <br /> Unity - Dissolving the illusion of separation.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Travel operates on the understanding that all separation is illusory. By harnessing this power, a wizard can navigate without traditional directions and locate objects or places that are lost or hidden. A skilled practitioner can transcend distance, stepping from one location to any desired destination.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Locate Lost Objects \u2022\u2022 Find Directions \u2022\u2022\u2022 See at a Distance \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Teleport Objects \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Make a Portal</pre> </div>Power of Transformation - Developing/Shapeshifting<br /> <br /> Personification - Authoring one's own identity.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Transformation allows a wizard to assume the form and essence of another being, whether it be an abstract concept, an animal, or even a deity. The essence of this mastery lies in the understanding that one has the power to create and define their own identity, refusing to be shaped by external forces. The power of transformation can also be used to improve who you already are.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Sense Physical Attributes \u2022\u2022 Bonus to Physical Tests \u2022\u2022\u2022 Developing Physical Traits \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Shapeshifting \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Transmutation of Objects</pre> </div>Power of Destruction - Curses/Annihilation<br /> <br /> Pragmatism - Dissolving the constructs of right and wrong.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Destruction holds immense power that should be wielded with caution. It encompasses the ability to curse, annihilate, and disrupt the natural order. However, the utilization of this power draws one away from their true path and blurs the distinction between right and wrong.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Sense Black Magic \u2022\u2022 Protection from Curses \u2022\u2022\u2022 Curse Enemies \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Cause Physical Damage \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Kill &amp; Destroy</pre> </div>Power of Revelation - Visions/Rapture<br /> <br /> Above as Below - The symbiotic connection between gods, angels, and humanity.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Power of Revelation unveils profound visions and grants enlightenment to the practitioner. It is rooted in the understanding of the symbiotic connection between gods, angels, and humanity. By tapping into this power, a wizard gains access to celestial knowledge, perceiving the intricate tapestry that binds all realms and entities together.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">\u2022 Sense Spirits \u2022\u2022 Speak with Spirits \u2022\u2022\u2022 Banish Spirits \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Summon Spirits \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Spirit Travel</pre> </div>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27363,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27363-street","user":"Street","date":". 11-07-2023, 11:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27363-street","name":"Street","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-12T07:24:31-07:00","id":1517765,"title":"","content":"I've dabbled with this idea myself over the years. What I've settled on is the idea that the Traditions use the standard nine-Sphere model, though some mages supplement that with a Minor Sphere or two: see <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/388362\" target=\"_blank\">the Book of Fragments</a> for a robust take on Minor Spheres, noting that this is a Storyteller's Vault product, and strictly unofficial.<br /> <br /> If I had the time and energy to flesh this out, the Crafts, meanwhile, would tend to feature modern-day versions of the Foundation and Pillars system found in <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/2674\" target=\"_blank\">Dark Ages: Mage</a>, with each Craft having its own Foundation incorporating elements of a Focus that its members can't stray too far away from, and a set of Pillars that function more or less like modern Spheres but with a different organizing principle for each Craft. In effect, Alternative Spheres. <br /> <br /> For the Technocracy, I have worked out a system of Enlightenment and Fields that started out by taking the nine Spheres, subbing in all three of the Technocratic Variants from M20, and then tweaking them a bit further so that they'd reflect the way that Technocrats use Enlightened Science. That said, Enlightenment and Fields is, in practice, not really any different from what the Crafts do: the Technocratic Foundation is Enlightenment, and its Pillars are the Fields. <br /> <br /> The problem here is that making Alternative Spheres is <i>hard</i>, as in labor-intensive. Making <i>one</i> alternate <i>set</i> of Spheres is almost overwhelmingly difficult; and making one set <i>per Craft</i> is too much work. <br /> <br /> And then there are the Orphans, or independent mages. My thought for <i>them</i> has been to see if it's possible to do away with Spheres altogether: let them learn individual Rotes, without needing to learn Spheres in order to do so, but then give them an improvisational ability to perform Rotes that they <i>haven't</i> learned by using the Rotes that they <i>have</i> learned as a starting point, increasing the Difficulty based on how similar or different the improvised Rote is from known Rotes.<br /> <br /> This idea is very much a work in progress, currently in the alpha stage of production; I don't know if I'll ever get it to work. But if I can, I suspect that the end product <i>won't</i> be restricted to Orphans. If Orphans can learn Rotes without Spheres, then so can Traditions, Crafts, and even Technocrats \u2014 and there might even be some benefit to doing it in moderation, even when you have Spheres or Fields or Pillars available to you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-17T23:13:07-07:00","id":1518216,"title":"","content":"I once, though I don't think it's saved anywhere, wrote a layout for a type of traditional Daoist mage that instead of using the 9 sphere system basically used a quasi pillar system, with there being only 3 (And an altered point buy to account for the massively decreased amount of spheres).<br /> Honestly in retrospect? Fits better for a sorcerer using sorcery paths. But they revolved around the Man/Earth/Heaven trio. Earth had underworld aspects in it IIRC, and dealt with certain parts of the soul. Heaven dealt with a few mind aspects, and other parts of the soul. Man did traditionally magic-y things, this is where the cool thunder magic would be.<br /> <br /> I've honestly enjoyed the concept of, but never had a chance to use in practice, the simpler examples of minor spheres. 'Sphere of fire' is pretty dang easy to conceptualize. Let it do something with fire forces can't normally do till 3, at like 2. Make it more niche in regards to fire. Let it do a bit more than it normally could do at different sphere levels to represent specializing in fire. And bam you have yourself a custom sphere.<br /> <br /> I find it easier to just write out what the spheres can do per level like the core book does instead of just coming up with rotes for each level, helps keep things fluid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25315-jihelu","name":"Jihelu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-22T01:59:16-07:00","id":1518494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1517747-alternative-spheres?p=1517765#post1517765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For the Technocracy, I have worked out a system of Enlightenment and Fields that started out by taking the nine Spheres, subbing in all three of the Technocratic Variants from M20, and then tweaking them a bit further so that they'd reflect the way that Technocrats use Enlightened Science. That said, Enlightenment and Fields is, in practice, not really any different from what the Crafts do: the Technocratic Foundation is Enlightenment, and its Pillars are the Fields.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>One matter and category of details to remember in regard to Procedures, Adjustments, and Effects of Technocrats ( for example from the Syndicate Convention, or else from the Iteration-X Convention ) is that they often ask for help, and can depend on support, from Enlightened Scientists of other Methodologies, Conventions, ideologies, and approaches. Also it has to be noted that Technocrats extensively use Devices, and also as well various special technological items that might seem relatively mundane.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-15T19:11:34-07:00","id":1537449,"title":"","content":"I've made an updated version of this available on the V5 Homebrew Wiki at <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.v5homebrew.com/wiki/Alternate_Sphere_Magic\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.v5homebrew.com/mw/resources/assets/poweredby_mediawiki_88x31.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.v5homebrew.com/wiki/Alternate_Sphere_Magic\" target=\"_blank\"> Alternate Sphere Magic - V5 Homebrew Wiki </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.v5homebrew.com/wiki/Alternate_Sphere_Magic\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.v5homebrew.com/wiki/Alternate_Sphere_Magic </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27363-street","name":"Street","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}